OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner seeks protection for
OL,4,A'unwell' river
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner says he wants to see the
OL,7,FRiver Teme given more legal rights
OL,8,Fbecause he believes it has become
OL,9,F"unwell".
OL,11,FSam Jones, who lives in Shropshire,
OL,12,Fsays he has seen a decline in aquatic
OL,13,Fspecies and an "invasion" by non-native
OL,14,Fspecies of both plants and animals.
OL,16,FInspired by the River Wye, which in May
OL,17,Fbecame the first river in the UK to be
OL,18,Fgiven cross-border rights covering it
OL,19,Ffrom source to sea, he has started a
OL,20,Fpetition which has so far been signed
OL,21,Fby more than a thousand people.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
