OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner seeks protection for
OL,4,A'unwell' river
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency said it took its
OL,7,Frole in cleaning rivers seriously and
OL,8,Fasked anyone with environmental or
OL,9,Fpollution concerns to report them.
